  </div>
</div>


<!-- ── ANNOTATION CALLOUTS ── -->
<div style="padding: 0 32px 24px; background: var(--bg);">
  <div class="callout-wrap">
    <div class="callout">
      <div class="callout-title">Left Column — Identity</div>
      <div class="callout-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Name at ~80px Outfit 800 weight — dominant, readable</li>
          <li>Last name in gold accent — separates first/last, adds character</li>
