          <li>Column ratio: roughly 55/45 at 1140px max-width</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout callout-right">
      <div class="callout-title">Right Column — Portrait Gallery</div>
      <div class="callout-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Aspect ratio: 3:4 (portrait) — needs new crops or portrait-native art</li>
          <li>object-fit: cover — wide art will center-crop automatically</li>
