          <li>Separate image set from horizontal hero on alt layout</li>
          <li>Gallery frame max-height capped at ~490px to not overwhelm left side</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ── DIVIDER: OPTION B NOTE ── -->
<div class="divider-label">
  <div class="divider-label-text">Also proposed — Option B (Nav name size increase only)</div>
  <div class="divider-label-line"></div>
</div>

<div class="option-b-wrap">
  <div class="option-b-inner">
    <div>
      <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;">Current → Proposed</div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
        <div class="option-b-nav-mock">
          <div>
            <div class="option-b-name-small">William McGuire</div>
            <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px;">20px / current</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="option-b-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="option-b-nav-mock">
          <div>
            <div class="option-b-name-large">William McGuire</div>
            <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px;">26px / proposed</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="option-b-note">
      <strong>This is the minimal change</strong> — just bumping <code style="color: var(--accent); font-size: 11px;">.nav-name</code> from 20px → 26px. No layout change.<br>
      Pairs with reducing <code style="color: var(--accent); font-size: 11px;">.sec-title</code> from 26px → 18–20px so "Disciplines" and "Clients" no longer outsize his name.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<script>
// Portrait gallery slideshow
(function() {
  var slides = document.querySelectorAll('.port-slide');
  var dots   = document.querySelectorAll('.port-dot');
  var count  = document.getElementById('portCount');
  var cur = 0, timer;

  function goTo(i) {
    slides[cur].classList.remove('active');
    dots[cur].classList.remove('active');
    cur = (i + slides.length) % slides.length;
    slides[cur].classList.add('active');
    dots[cur].classList.add('active');
    if (count) count.textContent = (cur + 1) + ' / ' + slides.length;
  }
  function startTimer() { clearInterval(timer); timer = setInterval(function() { goTo(cur + 1); }, 4000); }

  document.getElementById('portPrev').addEventListener('click', function() { goTo(cur - 1); startTimer(); });
  document.getElementById('portNext').addEventListener('click', function() { goTo(cur + 1); startTimer(); });
  dots.forEach(function(d) {
    d.addEventListener('click', function() { goTo(parseInt(d.dataset.index)); startTimer(); });
  });
  startTimer();
})();
</script>

